# Files the Vercel build doesn't need. Vercel already skips .git, node_modules,
# .vercel, .DS_Store and .env*.local, and only dist/ is ever served.
#
# Never list anything the build reads: index.html, src/, public/, package.json,
# package-lock.json, tsconfig.json, vercel.json (or a future vite.config.ts).

# Docs and local tooling
README.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Local build and test output, rebuilt on Vercel
dist/
coverage/
